# Maximum size in bytes that a message may be. Without this file there is no
# limit and qpsmtpd does not advertise SIZE in its EHLO reply.
#
# It also bounds memory: while reading DATA, header lines accumulate in memory
# until the blank line that ends the header. This is what limits that.
#
# Keep it below what the backend MTA accepts. 50MB is deliberately generous;
# Postfix defaults to 10MB (message_size_limit).
52428800
